enterMrn.title = What is the Movement Reference Number (MRN)?
enterMrn.heading = What is the Movement Reference Number (MRN)?
enterMrn.hint = This is the 18-character reference from the EU export declaration. For example, 24AB123456789012A1.
enterMrn.checkYourAnswersLabel = MRN
enterMrn.error.required = Enter `enterMrn`
enterMrn.error.length = EnterMrn must be 18 characters
enterMrn.error.invalid = EnterMrn must be in the correct format, for example 24AB123456789012A1
enterMrn.change.hidden = MRN
enterMrn.caption = Export operation

enterDucr.title = What is the Declaration Unique Consignment Reference (DUCR)?
enterDucr.heading = What is the Declaration Unique Consignment Reference (DUCR)?
enterDucr.hint = This links the movement to the underlying export declaration in CDS. It must match the DUCR used on the original declaration. The DUCR must be valid and not already linked to another MRN - if it is, your submission will be rejected.
enterDucr.summary.title = Where to find the DUCR
enterDucr.summary.message = The DUCR was assigned when the export declaration was submitted to CDS. You can find it on the declaration confirmation or by checking with the declarant.
enterDucr.checkYourAnswersLabel = DUCR
enterDucr.error.required = Enter enterDucr
enterDucr.error.length = EnterDucr must be 35 characters or less
enterDucr.error.invalid = EnterDucr must only include letters and numbers
enterDucr.change.hidden = EnterDucr
enterDucr.caption = Consignment details

partOfConsolidation.title = Is this part of a consolidation?
partOfConsolidation.heading = Is this part of a consolidation?
partOfConsolidation.hint = If this consignment is grouped under a Master UCR (MUCR) with other declarations, select yes. Otherwise, select no.
partOfConsolidation.no = No - this is a standalone consignment
partOfConsolidation.yes = Yes - enter the MUCR
partOfConsolidation.mucr = Master Unique Consignment Reference (MUCR)
partOfConsolidation.mucr.hint = Up to 35 characters. This groups multiple DUCRs under one parent reference. The MUCR must be in an open state - if it has already been closed, your submission will be rejected.
partOfConsolidation.checkYourAnswersLabel = Is this part of a consolidation?
partOfConsolidation.error.required = Select yes if partOfConsolidation
partOfConsolidation.mucr.required = MUCR required
partOfConsolidation.mucr.length = MUCR must be 35 characters or less
partOfConsolidation.mucr.invalid = MUCR must only include letters and numbers
partOfConsolidation.change.hidden = PartOfConsolidation

isSplitExit.title = Is this a split exit?
isSplitExit.heading = Is this a split exit?
isSplitExit.hint = A split exit is when parts of the same consignment leave the UK at different times or from different locations.
isSplitExit.no = No, the full consignment is exiting together
isSplitExit.checkYourAnswersLabel = Is this a split exit?
isSplitExit.yes = Yes, this is a split exit
isSplitExit.error.required = Select yes if isSplitExit
isSplitExit.change.hidden = IsSplitExit

anyDiscrepancies.title = Are there any discrepancies with this consignment?
anyDiscrepancies.heading = Are there any discrepancies with this consignment?
anyDiscrepancies.checkYourAnswersLabel = Are there any discrepancies with this consignment?
anyDiscrepancies.error.required = Select yes if anyDiscrepancies
anyDiscrepancies.change.hidden = AnyDiscrepancies
anyDiscrepancies.hint = Select yes if the goods, transport, or packaging differ from what was declared on the original export declaration. Only reductions in goods, weight or quantity can be declared. Increases are not accepted.
anyDiscrepancies.no = No, everything matches the declaration
anyDiscrepancies.yes = Yes, there are discrepancies
anyDiscrepancies.yes.hint = You will need to provide details about the affected goods, transport, seals, and packaging.

