startSubmission.title = Submit an IE507(a) Arrival at Exit pre-notification
startSubmission.heading = Submit an IE507(a) Arrival at Exit pre-notification
startSubmission.message1 = Use this service to tell HMRC about EU exports that will move through Northern Ireland. This is called an IE507(a) Arrival at Exit pre-notification.
startSubmission.bullet.head1 = You can
startSubmission.bullet1 = Submit a new IE507(a) pre-notification
startSubmission.bullet2 = View, change or cancel an existing submission
startSubmission.bullet.head2 = Before you start
startSubmission.bullet3 = If you don't have one, apply for a EORI before you start
startSubmission.bullet4 = You must submit this pre-notification before the goods arrive at the port or terminal where they'll leave the UK
startSubmission.bullet5 = You won't be able to save your progress, so make sure you have the following information before you start
startSubmission.bullet.head3 = You'll need
startSubmission.bullet6 = the EU Movement Reference Number (MRN)
startSubmission.bullet7 = the Declaration Unique Consignment Reference (DUCR)
startSubmission.bullet8 = the Master Unique Consignment Reference (MUCR) if required
startSubmission.bullet9 = details of where the goods will leave the UK, and if they'll leave together or separately
startSubmission.bullet10 = details of anything that doesn't match the export declaration, including goods, weight, packaging or transportation
startSubmission.inset = The full IE507 will be completed when the arrival (EAL) message is submitted at the point of exit.

standardSubmissionConfirmation.title = IE507(a) pre-notification received
standardSubmissionConfirmation.heading = IE507(a) pre-notification received
standardSubmissionConfirmation.subHeading1 = What happens next
standardSubmissionConfirmation.message1 = We have sent your pre-notification to the Customs Declaration Service for validation. This usually takes a few minutes but can take up to 15 minutes in some cases.
standardSubmissionConfirmation.message2 = You will receive one of the following outcomes:
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet1.heading = Accepted
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet1.message = - your pre-notification has passed validation and the movement can proceed
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet2.heading = Rejected
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet2.message = - there is a problem with your submission and you will need to correct and resubmit
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet3.heading = Awaiting decision
standardSubmissionConfirmation.bullet3.message = - we are checking with the EU member state of export (this may take longer)
standardSubmissionConfirmation.message3 = Once the goods arrive at the port of exit and the arrival (EAL) message is submitted, CDS will combine both to create the full IE507 Arrival at Exit notification.
standardSubmissionConfirmation.inset.heading = Important:
standardSubmissionConfirmation.inset.message = Keep your reference number. You can return to check the status of this submission or make amendments within 28 days.
standardSubmissionConfirmation.subHeading2 = If you need to make changes
standardSubmissionConfirmation.message4 = You can amend most details of this pre-notification before the goods arrive at the port of exit. However, the MRN and DUCR cannot be amended - you would need to cancel and resubmit.
standardSubmissionConfirmation.link1 = View your submissions
standardSubmissionConfirmation.link2 = Submit another IE507(a) notification

